chapter.v:
My son, 


if you, 


have put up security for your neighbor, have given your pledge for a stranger,

Give your 


eyes no, 


sleep and your eyelids no slumber;

with perverted 


heart devises, 


evil, continually sowing discord;

Do not 


desire her, 


beauty in your heart, and do not let her capture you with her eyelashes;
